# IMas — Project overview & Find Houses theme integration

This repository is a **real estate** product built on the **HadoSaaS** modular Laravel starter (see repo root `README.md` and `DDD_LITE_ARCHITECTURE.md`). **Admin** workflows use Blade (and related tooling). **End-user (front-office) pages** are implemented with **Laravel + Inertia.js + Vue 3**, using Vite entrypoints `resources/css/app.css` and `resources/js/app.js`, with root shell `resources/views/app.blade.php`.

Pair this rule with **Brand-accent-colors.mdc** for client Navy `#1a2a4a` and Gold `#d9a800` accent overrides (do not redesign base theme chrome).

---

## Application scope & features (by module)

| Module | Role | Typical features / domains |
|--------|------|-----------------------------|
| **Core** | Shared infrastructure | Helpers, macros, contracts, cross-cutting services (e.g. translation), console commands |
| **Base** | Platform configuration | Site settings, SEO, logs, media library, about-us admin content |
| **User** | Identity & admin HR | Users, roles, permissions (Spatie), staff, dashboard, auth (`Register.vue`, etc.) |
| **Cms** | Editorial content | Pages, blog, categories, FAQs |
| **Corporate** | Marketing / company | Services, team, testimonials (admin routes under `admin`) |
| **Property** | Real estate catalog | Properties (multilingual fields, types, locations, slides, attributes, citizenship flags, featured/recommended), Turkish citizenship admin screen |
| **Support** | Lead capture | Subscribers, contact-oriented flows |

**Routing conventions**

- **Localized web routes**: Many modules wrap `routes/web.php` in `mcamara/laravel-localization` groups (`localeSessionRedirect`, `localizationRedirect`, `localeViewPath`).
- **Admin**: `prefix('admin')`, `middleware(['web', 'auth', 'is_admin'])`, names prefixed with `admin.`.

**Current front-office note**: Home is `Modules/Base/routes/web.php` → `Inertia::render('Base::Index')`. `Modules/Property/routes/web.php` registers `Route::resource('property', ...)` returning Blade views (`property::index`, etc.) — **still placeholders** relative to the Inertia + Find Houses direction described below.

