## Theme repository layout

Two distinct trees live under `theme/`:

### 1. `theme/documentation/` — vendor HTML docs (Code-Theme)

Static documentation for the template (Bootstrap-oriented docs CSS). **Reference only** for structure/CSS explanations — **not** the runtime asset source for the buyer-facing site.

- Entry: `theme/documentation/index.html`
- Examples: `theme/documentation/css/style.css`, `scrollbar.css`, `bootstrap.css`

### 2. `theme/findhouses/` — **Find Houses** HTML5 multi-page template (primary integration source)

This is the **purchase theme** used to build **user-facing** UI. Vendor: **Code-Theme** (“Find Houses”). Bootstrap-based, heavy use of archives CSS and jQuery-era plugins.

**High-signal directories & files**

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `theme/findhouses/*.html` | Full page demos (home variants, listings, single property, blog, agents, auth, etc.) |
| `theme/findhouses/css/` | Main styles: `bootstrap.min.css`, `styles.css`, `menu.css`, `maps.css`, component CSS (`animate`, `aos`, `magnific-popup`, `lightcase`, `owl.carousel`, `slick`, `search.css`, …) |
| `theme/findhouses/css/colors/` | Color skins (e.g. `pink.css`) — switch via `<link id="color" href="css/colors/pink.css">` in demos |
| `theme/findhouses/js/` | Theme scripts (sliders, maps, counters, `markers.json` for map markers per vendor docs, etc.) |
| `theme/findhouses/images/` | Logos, placeholders, icons |
| `theme/findhouses/font/` | Flaticon bundle (`flaticon.css`) |
| `theme/findhouses/fonts/` | Additional icon/font assets |
| `theme/findhouses/fontawesome-*` | Font Awesome 5.x web-font bundle |
| `theme/findhouses/libs/` | Bundled third-party libs (Owl Carousel, tiny-slider, mmenu, hc-sticky, …) — treat as **vendor**; prefer CDN or npm equivalents when integrating if duplicates cause conflicts |

**Representative demo pages** (map to product features when porting):

- Home / hero / search: `index.html`, `index-*.html` (many layouts: map, slider, video, parallax)
- Listings grid/list + map: `properties-*.html`, `properties-top-map-*.html`
- Single property: `single-property-*.html`
- Blog: `blog-*.html`
- Agents / agencies: `agents-*.html`, `agencies-details.html`
- Auth / account: `login.html`, `register.html`, `user-profile.html`, `submit-property.html`, `add-property.html`
- Static: `faq.html`, `coming-soon.html`

Use **`theme/findhouses/index.html`** as the canonical reference for **head asset order** (fonts → icon CSS → archives → `styles.css` → color skin).

